# Enterprise Intelligent Log Analysis Platform

Enterprise-grade log analytics platform built using Python for scalable log ingestion, parsing, monitoring, and intelligent operational analytics.

---

## Objectives

- Build scalable log parsing pipelines
- Process structured/unstructured logs
- Enable operational intelligence
- Prepare architecture for ML & AI integrations
- Demonstrate enterprise Python engineering practices

---

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Pandas
- Pydantic
- Pytest

---

## Project Roadmap

### Phase 1
- Modular architecture
- Log parsing engine
- Error categorization
- Config-driven processing

### Phase 2
- Async processing
- REST APIs
- Analytics engine

### Phase 3
- ML anomaly detection
- Predictive analytics

### Phase 4
- GenAI incident summarization
- Agentic AI remediation workflows
